    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      157.17,
      326.57,
      396.61,
      351.23
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Finance Act, No. of2019.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      260.85,
      366.53,
      293.13,
      377.87
    ],
    "text": "PART I",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      393.05,
      392.01,
      404.39
    ],
    "text": "AMENDMENT OF PART VII OF THE FINANCE ACT, NO. 35 OF 2018",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      157.17,
      419.69,
      396.74,
      470.87
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 23 of the Finance Act, No. 35 of 2018 ishereby amended by the substitution for the definition of theexpression \u201cspecified motor vehicle\u201d of the followingdefinition:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      169.17,
      486.17,
      291.36,
      497.51
    ],
    "text": "\u201c \u201cspecified motor vehicle\u201d\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      184.89,
      512.81,
      396.73,
      671.03
    ],
    "text": "(a)in relation to a vehicle of which the firstregistration falls prior to July 1, 2019, meansany assembled or unassembled diesel motorvehicle of which the cylinder capacity exceeds2,300 CC or a petrol motor vehicle of which thecylinder capacity exceeds 1,800 CC or an electricvehicle of which motor power of the engineexceeds 200 Kw, but shall not include a dualpurpose petrol motor vehicle the cylindercapacity of which does not exceed 2,200 CC,a dual purpose electric motor vehicle, a van,a single cab or a wagon;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      402.69,
      421.39,
      448.42,
      468.86
    ],
    "text": "Amendmentof section 23of Act,No. 35 of2018.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
