    "bbox": [
      184.17,
      520.13,
      396.74,
      578.27
    ],
    "text": "\u201cstored-value card\u201d means, a payment card or anyother device with access to a stored value that canbe used as a means of payment and does notinclude a card that can be used only to settlepayment obligations to the issuer of such card.",
